WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Huh. Massive, and it weighs nothing.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Weight isn't the problem. That crate holds an entire frontier-grade brain.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Downloading took five minutes. The actual job starts now.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
I am currently being launched backwards!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
It's up. Running, and it never touched anyone else's server.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The whole world downloaded this thing. Almost nobody has anywhere to run it.

